# Used by the images whose build context is the repository root (the
# vulnerability connector and the honeypot shipper). Nothing but their source
# files is sent to Docker, so
# secrets, certificates and fetched upstream code never enter the build.
*
!ticketing/forwarder/td_forwarder.py
!vulnerability/connector/td_vuln
!vulnerability/connector/td_vuln/*.py
!honeypot/shipper/td_honeypot.py
**/__pycache__
